181	  // reading it in full rather than trusting a paraphrase: its OWN per-line lookup map
182	  // (`productsByItemId`, a second, separate useMemo) is keyed by `productItem.itemId`, but is
183	  // itself built from `products?.[productItem?.productId]` — i.e. the raw `useProducts` fetch
184	  // below is keyed by PRODUCT id, not item id, and the re-keying-by-itemId step exists there only
185	  // to support the bundle-child-inventory enrichment this container does not replicate. This
186	  // container looks the fetched product up by `productId` directly, with no intermediate re-keyed
187	  // map.
188	  // The generated `getProducts` query parameters type this SDK call resolves against
189	  // (`getProductsQueryParameters`, commerce-sdk-isomorphic) types `ids` as `Array<string>` — base
