201	  // generic is hard-coded to match the first), so a `select` reshaping into a keyed map does not
202	  // type-check here even though base's own untyped `.jsx` equivalent does exactly this via its
203	  // own `select`. A `useMemo` outside the hook achieves the identical keyed-by-product-id shape.
204	  const productsById = useMemo(
